  title: The beginning
  description: 'This story starts after a brawl between four strangers that have
    been accused of making a rucus in a Silver Talon Inn, a famous Dartmundian tavern
    located at the southeast border. Luckily or unluckly for the strangers, the guards
    who were on duty were drunk so taking care of them wasn''t too big of a problem.
    Just as the last guard was defeated, a necklace containing a green gem was tossed
    towards the commosion. A bright green light started eminating from the gem. '
  image: {fileID: 0}
